\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9.4}{\ignorespaces Error detection on AutoTest (Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct, repo zero-shot prompt). Precision is averaged over columns with a prediction, recall over columns with errors, and F1 is taken from the two averages (the repo's \texttt {ed\_evaluator}); the AutoTest protocol ignores predictions of debatable values.}}{59}{table.9.4}%
